# Unity Windows build output. We do NOT commit the game binaries or Unity's shipped runtime
# (D3D12, MonoBleedingEdge, *_Data, backup folders, etc.) - both because of Unity's sample
# license and because it would bloat the repo by ~100 MB. Users build their own instrumented
# TrashCat.exe following App/README.md and drop it under App/TrashCatWindows/.
App/TrashCatWindows/**
!App/TrashCatWindows/
!App/TrashCatWindows/.gitkeep
